AI Verify Testing Framework (AIVTF) — Process Checklist
Source: Infocomm Media Development Authority (IMDA) & AI Verify Foundation.

The catalog content in aivtf-catalog.json (principles, outcomes, process
descriptions, evidence guidance) is derived from the publicly published AIVTF
Process Checklist workbook and framework PDF published by the AI Verify
Foundation (https://aiverifyfoundation.sg/). Attribution to IMDA and the AI
Verify Foundation. The source workbook and PDF are not redistributed in this
repository; download them from the AI Verify Foundation to re-run
scripts/extract-aivtf-catalog.py.

This file documents provenance; consult the original publication for the
authoritative framework text and any usage terms.
